| Column Name      | Data Type            | Description                                                                           |
| ---------------- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **id**           | string               | identity ID of the game in igdb.                                                      |
| **name**         | object (string)      | Name/title of the game or product.                                                    |
| **genres**       | object (string/list) | Genre classification(s) |
| **release_date** | datetime64[ns]       | Official release date of the game (converted to pandas datetime).                     |
